प्रति-√ लभ् Ā. -लभते, to receive back, recover, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to obtain, gain, partake of (acc.), MBh.; BhP.;
to get back i.e. get punished, MBh.;
to learn, understand, MBh.; R.;
to expect, R. :
Pass. -लभ्यते, to be obtained or met with, appear, Śaṃk. :
Caus. -लम्भयति, to provide or present with (instr.), HPariś.
